   "evidence": "Repo convention: grep `^@\\[expose\\] public section` under code/TauCeti finds 51 files, while `^public section` finds about 18,059. Downstream only needs `d\u2083\u2084_hom_apply` (from `@[simps!]`), `mem_cocycles\u2083_def/iff` and `mem_coboundaries\u2083_iff`, all of which exist; no consumer has to compute with `cochainsIso\u2084` or `d\u2083\u2084` definitionally.",
