   "fix": "Use plain `public section`. Add `isMulCocycle\u2083_iff` / `isMulCoboundary\u2083_iff` restatement lemmas (proved `Iff.rfl`) so downstream code (the pentagon proof for `VecTwisted`) can use the predicates without unfolding them; if exposure is still wanted, put `@[expose]` only on those two Prop predicates.",
